          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "name": "Top Chrome",
          "context": "Header backdrop (ChatHeaderBackdrop): over the thread, a blur of it (20 dp, API 31+) and bg-chat at 80% through the status bar and bar row, smoothstep to clear over 28 dp below it; API 30 draws bg-chat at 94% with no blur. Faded in only while the thread has content under the bar.",
