      "context": "Android only. Phone locked or screen off: the same incoming-call screen as in the app, launched by the call notification's full-screen intent and shown over the lock screen (showWhenLocked, turnScreenOn). Answer connects without unlocking the phone; chats stay locked behind it, and leaving the call screen lands on the system lock screen. Android 14+ needs the full-screen-intent permission; without it the phone shows the heads-up notification on the lock screen instead.",
