      "context": "Android only. Adding a fingerprint or face, or removing the screen lock, invalidates the Keystore key that wraps the history key (setInvalidatedByBiometricEnrollment). The lock screen then offers only the phrase; entering it re-derives the key and wraps it under a fresh Keystore key. Also shown when the Keystore entry is missing after a restore.",
