    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "bpEGH",
      "x": 5292,
      "y": 13281,
      "name": "About Shroud",
      "context": "Settings › Appearance. Inline app-bar title. Theme: System (default), Light or Dark, kept on this phone only and cleared by Log Out; System follows the phone's setting. The call screen and photo/video compose still go dark over it. Logo: Detailed draws the app icon's veil with folds and shading (design/icon/shroud-icon.svg), Simple the flat veil (shroud-icon-simple.svg); changing it also changes the launcher icon by switching activity-alias, without a system alert — the launcher may take a moment to show it. If the switch fails, a red 13 sp line under the Logo footer reads “The app icon couldn’t be changed. Try again.” Rows highlight on press; the checkmark swaps with Motion.iconSwap. Switching the theme cross-fades the whole window over 0.3 s.",
